"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Academic Details</span></span></span></strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; height: 52.7pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 52.7pt;\" width=\"100%\">\n<h4 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline; color: #333399;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB;\">Qualification</span></span></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">• MCA\n• BCA</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; height: 22.45pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; background: #002060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Areas of Interest</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; height: 52.7pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 52.7pt;\" width=\"100%\">\n<ol>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Machine Learning</li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Digital Forensics</li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Deep Learning</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; height: 22.45pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; background: #002060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Publication Details</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; height: 52.7pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 52.7pt;\" width=\"100%\">\n<ol>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">“Fraudulent login detection using AI” Published in IJSRD - International Journal for Scientific Research &amp; Development| Vol. 12, Issue 12, 2025 | ISSN (online): 2321-0613https://www.ijsrd.com/articles/IJSRDV12I120018.pdf</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; height: 22.45pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; background: #002060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Fdps/Conferences/Workshops/Sttp/Mooc Certification</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; height: 52.7pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 52.7pt;\" width=\"100%\">\n<ol>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Completed the NPTEL course on - Digital Forensics</li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Attended FDP on “Artificial intelligence, Machine Learning and Deep Learning in the Data Revolution Era: Progress and Applications” organized by Dept. of CSE, ATME College of Engineering, Mysuru on 3<sup>rd</sup> to 5<sup>th</sup>&nbsp; February 2025.</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.45pt; text-align: justify;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; bord